    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game MorphaVerse</h2><br>MorphaVerse is a turn-based combat, monster taming, deckbuilding game.<br>In MorphaVerse you explore different worlds, collect monsters with which you create your team for fights.<br>The fights are supported by cards, which means you not only need monsters for your fights but also cards.<br>The battles in MorphaVerse are turn-based in which you have to use your cards and monsters skillfully to win.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Story campaign: in which you explore the secrets of the MorphaVerse, collect your monsters and cards and fight your battles.<br></li><li> Taming Monsters: you have many monsters to choose from, some of which evolve as you level them up.<br></li><li> Card deck: the cards you use significantly influence your strategy in battle.<br></li><li> Different story endings: In MorphaVerse, your actions will influence the course of the game.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game MorphaVerse</h2><br>MorphaVerse is a turn-based combat, monster taming, deckbuilding game.<br>In MorphaVerse you explore different worlds, collect monsters with which you create your team for fights.<br>The fights are supported by cards, which means you not only need monsters for your fights but also cards.<br>The battles in MorphaVerse are turn-based in which you have to use your cards and monsters skillfully to win.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Story campaign: in which you explore the secrets of the MorphaVerse, collect your monsters and cards and fight your battles.<br></li><li> Taming Monsters: you have many monsters to choose from, some of which evolve as you level them up.<br></li><li> Card deck: the cards you use significantly influence your strategy in battle.<br></li><li> Different story endings: In MorphaVerse, your actions will influence the course of the game.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore the world of MorphaVerse, collect and train monsters for your team. Use cards to support your monsters in battle!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
